      ARBCHAIN(m=0, k=3): n= 17 actors= 6, THE arbitration at index 7 (height 5, 4 registers, 3 proposers, live out-degree 3); D(1)=[8, 9, 10] kinds ['d', 'd', 'd'] out-degrees [2, 2, 2]; |D_e(2)| = 6 (= k*m + 2*(k-m) = 6), Bl = 3, W4c bound 9
